    "root_causes": [
      "During the 150-episode training run (2221 total steps), epsilon decayed slowly from 1.0 to 0.2997 (decay=0.992 per episode). Exploratory actions selected DROP_INDEX 228 times and CHANGE_JOIN_STRATEGY 220 times; whenever redundant_index_count==0 (~50% of initial states) or nested_loop_fraction<=0.2, the sandbox simulator penalized those actions as -60% and -12% latency regressions, accumulating 303 training regression events.",
      "In DatabaseOptimizationEnv._generate_initial_state(), total_db_size_mb was sampled exclusively from Uniform(400, 1200) > 300 MB, and _transition_state() never updated total_db_size_mb after PARTITION_TABLE. Consequently, PARTITION_TABLE yielded +25%..+45% reward unconditionally on every training state (846/2221 steps = 38.1%), causing the greedy Q-network to collapse to PARTITION_TABLE even on out-of-distribution small tables (<= 300 MB) where partitioning causes a -10% regression.",
      "DEFAULT_ARTIFACT_DIR in persistence.py previously pointed to 'ai/rl/models/v0.8.0' instead of 'backend/app/services/rl/model_artifacts/v0.8.0', causing RLInferenceService to silently fall back to BaselinePolicy at runtime unless explicitly given the artifact path."
    ]
  },
